<title>UK: NTT sets 250 million stg seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>NTT sets 250 million stg seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NIPPON TELEGRAPH AND TELEPHONE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    02.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    02.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.00 PCT GILT DUE 2003</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
